<!-- pro-motion first-party beacon (pm-collector Worker). Classic deferred
     script on purpose: pm.js reads document.currentScript, which is undefined
     in modules. Cookieless — no cookie, no localStorage, no cross-site
     identifier — which is why this page needs no consent banner. Custom events
     go through src/components/analytics/track.ts.

     Cloudflare Web Analytics used to sit here too and never recorded a single
     pageload: its beacon posts to /cdn-cgi/rum on this origin, and the Worker
     route answers that path with a 404, so every report was dropped. The
     first-party beacon measures the same Web Vitals and more, on one script
     instead of two. -->
<script
  is:inline
  defer
  src="https://pm-collector.igor-ganov.workers.dev/pm.js"
  data-project="dovego-it"></script>
